		{
			"id":"2fbb939bb9e7202a",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"| Sensor Type | nuScenes Quantity     | K-Radar Quantity                             |\n| ----------- | --------------------- | -------------------------------------------- |\n| Camera      | 6 (RGB cameras)       | 4 (Stereo cameras, providing 8 total images) |\n| Lidar       | 1 (Spinning, 32-beam) | 2 (One 64-channel and one 128-channel)       |\n| Radar       | 5 (Conventional FMCW) | 1 (4D Radar sensor)                          |\n| GPS         | 1 (Integrated suite)  | 1 (RTK-GPS)                                  |\n| IMU         | Included in GPS suite | 2 (Built into the Lidars)                    |",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":3493,
			"y":20,
			"width":795,
			"height":320
		}
